{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120177","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120177/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120177/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120177/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120177","id":4636841053,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFGCUXQ","number":120177,"title":"Dragging GDScript from FileSystem onto Scene node no longer attaches the script in 4.7 RC1","user":{"login":"Jiayibingping","id":138685418,"node_id":"U_kgDOCEQr6g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138685418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping","html_url":"https://github.com/Jiayibingping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jiayibingping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-11T03:06:18Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T05:53:12Z","closed_at":"2026-06-11T05:33:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n\n\n- Reproducible in: Godot 4.7 RC1\n- Not reproducible in: Godot 4.7 beta 5\n\n\nGodot 4.7 RC1  Forward+ \n\n\n### System information\n\n Windows 11  \n\n### Issue description\n\nIn Godot 4.7 RC1, dragging a GDScript file from the FileSystem dock onto a compatible node in the Scene dock no longer attaches the script.\n\nThe same workflow works correctly in Godot 4.7 beta 5.\n\nThe script can still be attached manually through the Inspector, so the script itself appears to be valid. This seems to be a regression in the editor drag-and-drop workflow.\n\ngodot-4.7-beta5-drag-script-works：\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3920d3a-96e4-4389-837b-296c925b7bad\ngodot-4.7-rc1-drag-script-regression：\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a7b99b6-e75d-413f-bbd5-665a2546db6d\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project.\n2. Create a `Node2D` scene.\n3. Create a GDScript file with the following content:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n```\n4. Save the script.\n5. Drag the `.gd` file from the FileSystem dock onto the `Node2D` node in the Scene dock.\n6. Release the mouse button.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project\n\nN/A. This can be reproduced in a new empty project by following the steps above.\n","closed_by":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120177/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120177/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}